[STATE] after every option is chosen a quantity stepper is enabled and a stock number is shown {OBSERVED}

[DOM] counter reads "1 of 5 added" {SPEC}
[REL] the compared product title == p_title {SPEC}
[DOM] guest: the Wishlist button is disabled ("Wishlists are available only for authenticated users") {OBSERVED}

[DOM] the card shows "in Cart 1" {OBSERVED}
