[STATE] /cart lists p_title with quantity 1 {SPEC}

[MATH] line Total == "Price per item" × 3 {SPEC}
[MATH] Order summary Subtotal == the sum of all line totals {SPEC}
[MATH] Order summary Total == Subtotal − Discount + Tax + Shipping cost {SPEC}

[COUNT] 1 line left {OBSERVED}
[MATH] new Subtotal == s0 − t1 {SPEC}
